{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121252","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121252/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121252/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121252/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121252","id":4865139516,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIfwjPA","number":121252,"title":"Editor - Inspector - new values being displayed on top of old values","user":{"login":"ivoiv","id":11502345,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTAyMzQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11502345?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv","html_url":"https://github.com/ivoiv","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-07-12T02:48:16Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T09:08:23Z","closed_at":"2026-07-13T09:04:19Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.7.stable.mono.official [5b4e0cb0f], but it started sometime in 4.6.2 or 4.6.3. \n- Not reproducible in Godot 4.3 and 4.2.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (NVIDIA; 32.0.16.1047) - AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 61.65 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhenever i start editing values in the inspector, when I select the existing value, or start typing a new value, the old value is visible under the new one until I enter it or click away. The text is essentially doubled. It is also slightly offset by a pixel or two, with some fields being offset left and down, other fields being offset down and right.\n\nThis seems to affect only fields which always have a set value - coordinates, angles, scales etc.\nNullable/string fields with free text such as Path, Text, Label, etc, seem unaffected by this.\n\n<img width=\"348\" height=\"171\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e132935-bae7-4eed-8636-d1197f95cf67\" />\n\n<img width=\"333\" height=\"170\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/532c0b43-172e-4e03-bee3-ce62c91c86fd\" />\n\n<img width=\"246\" height=\"78\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5eaf21b9-e82f-45db-b3bf-ddf67367d5c9\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\nEncountered in fresh default project with no editor or project settings, as well as existing projects from older Godot versions, from 4.2 through 4.7. Completely deleting the Godot folder from %appdata% solved the issue for one session, then it came back the next session, without having done any changes to the editor settings.\n\nOpen any project and edit numerical inspector value, for example Custom Minimum Size on a Control node.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNot project dependant, new default blank project will do.","closed_by":{"login":"ivoiv","id":11502345,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTAyMzQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11502345?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv","html_url":"https://github.com/ivoiv","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121252/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121252/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}